From 58648bfccce5109a2588c6fc3587af6051c44eb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:16:39 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 105/230] Close 7 gaps: remove Predict tab, trim leagues to top
 5, fix lint

FIX 1: Remove Predict tab, Make Picks CTA, PredictionsHub, and all
prediction-related imports/state from MatchDetail. 3 tabs remain:
Timeline / Stats / Lineups.

FIX 2: Trim the league catalog to only the 5 big-five European leagues.
- types.ts: LEAGUES, COMPETITIONS, ALL_DOMESTIC narrowed; CUPS,
  INTERNATIONALS, NARROW_WINDOW removed; isCup/pollWindow stubbed.
- catalog.ts: EXTRA_COMPETITIONS import removed, only COMPETITIONS emitted.
- leagues.ts: cup slugs removed, isCup always false.
- teamGroups.ts: international SQL branch removed (IN () was invalid).
- seedTeams.ts already only had top-5 clubs (unchanged).

FIX 3: Browse and Table already had back={true} on their TopBar (verified).

FIX 4: TopBar and Login headers already borderless inside (verified).

FIX 5: Toast DWELL_MS.muted = 1500ms already in place (verified).

FIX 6: No navigator.onLine / online/offline listener / "you can update"
text exists in this codebase. The "Last sync" muted toast in Matches.tsx
auto-dismisses in 1500ms. React Query refetchOnWindowFocus handles
silent refetch on return. The "you can update" message the user saw is
likely Telegram WebApp's own behavior, not this app's code.

FIX 7: StatsPanel.tsx renders only team badges + StatBar list. No pitch,
no grid, no "no shots" message. PitchView/ShotPredictor not imported by
Stats tab (verified).

Typecheck: 0 errors. Lint: 0 errors, 2 pre-existing warnings.
Sync dry-run: only eng.1, esp.1, ita.1, ger.1, fra.1 polled.

Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
